        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer CL4010-6-652, 6\" Spring Hinge with Classic Ball Tips</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus #10 x 1\" wood screws and 10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Non-template screw hole pattern  for use on metal or wood  doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer spring hinges are certified Grade 1 (highest grade) for 1 million cycles and made in the USA. For wood or metal doors 1-1/4\" - 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available with out Ball Tips: <a href=\"/products/6-inch-single-acting-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-4010-6\"><b>Bommer 4010-6 6\" Spring Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension.  The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Bommer CL4010-6-652 6\" Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>652 Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .120</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 1</b> for 1 million cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81011</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4010-6.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer CL4010-6 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer CL4010-6 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>CL4010-6</td>\r\n<td>125 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>155 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/4\"</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\"><span class=\"text\">Bommer Hinges made in the USA</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 4010 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
